// csymm This function performs the symmetric matrix-matrix multiplication C={αAB+βCif side == [SideLeft]αBA+βCif side == [SideRight] where A is a symmetric matrix stored in lower or upper mode, B and C are m×n matrices, and α and β are scalars.
//
