// strsmBatched This function solves an array of triangular linear systems with multiple right-hand-sides {op(Ai)Xi=αBiif side == CUBLAS_SIDE_LEFTXiop(Ai)=αBiif side == [SideRight] where Ai is a triangular matrix stored in lower or upper mode with or without the main diagonal, Xi and Bi are m×n matrices, and α is a scalar.
