// zgemv This function performs the matrix-vector multiplication y=α op(A)x+βy where A is a m×n matrix stored in column-major format, x and y are vectors, and α and β are scalars.
//
// Also, for matrix A op(A)={A if trans == CUBLAS_OP_NAT if trans == CUBLAS_OP_TAH if trans == [OpC] The possible error values returned by this function and their meanings are listed below. For references please refer to NETLIB documentation: sgemv(), dgemv(), cgemv(), zgemv()
//
