//   - StatusInvalidValue: - If n < 0 or nrhs < 0, or - if trans is not one of [OpN], [OpT] and [OpC], or - if lda < max(1, n), or - if ldb < max(1, n)
//   - StatusNotInitialized: The library was not initialized
